Z||000004||WampusCat||04-04-2001||08:49 AM||||One thing to think about is that those early Chrys. digital dashes were notorious for interfering with radio reception from the car stereo.  On the '84 Laser I had, the radio would pick up tons of stations with the key in the acc. position (dash dark) but when the key was rotated to where the dash lit up, it would only pick up very strong stations within about 15-20 miles.||||reg||1
